OL,3,GGrampian
OL,4,
OL,5,CToday:FA little light and patchy rain
OL,6,Fspreading southeast this morning. Then
OL,7,Fthis afternoon will be dry with cloud
OL,8,Fbreaking to give some good spells of
OL,9,Fsunshine.
OL,10,
OL,11,CTonight:FThis evening will be dry with
OL,12,Fclear periods. Then the rest of the
OL,13,Fnight will remain dry but some high
OL,14,Fcloud spreading from the west. Chilly.
OL,15,
OL,16,CTuesday:FMostly dry with some bright
OL,17,For sunny spells, just the odd light
OL,18,Fshower across the west later. Somewhat
OL,19,Fcolder than of late.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
