OL,5,COutlook for Wednesday to Friday:FAfter
OL,6,Fa dry morning a few showers will
OL,7,Fdevelop in the afternoon. Early
OL,8,Fshowers on Thursday otherwise dry and
OL,9,Fbright, rain by evening. Early rain on
OL,10,FFriday then dry.
